es.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L).one ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i)) →\n          (∀ x ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i),\n              (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L).inv x ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i)) →\n            (∀ x ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i),\n                ∀ y ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i),\n                  (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L).Defined x y) →\n              ∀ (C : Set H),\n                IsCompact C →\n                  (π.toFun '' DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i)) ⊆ C →\n                    ∀ W ∈ nhds 1,\n                      (π.toFun ⁻¹' W ⊆ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i)) →\n                        (∀ (F V : Set H),\n                            IsCompact F →\n                              IsOpen V →\n                                F ⊆ V →\n                                  V ⊆ W →\n                                    ∃ B,\n                                      (π.toFun ⁻¹' F ⊆ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ∧\n                                        (DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ⊆ π.toFun ⁻¹' V) →\n                          ∃ K R,\n                            1 ≤ K ∧\n                              0 < R ∧\n                                ∀ (r : ℝ),\n                                  0 < r →\n                                    r < R →\n                                      ∃ B J,\n                                        1 ≤ J ∧\n                                          (π.toFun ⁻¹' DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.closedBall 0 r ⊆\n                                              DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ∧\n                                            (DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ⊆\n                                                π.toFun ⁻¹'\n                                                  DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.ball 0 (1001 / 1000 * r) ∧\n                                              ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U,\n                                                B i ⊆ A i ∧\n                                                  (A i).card ≤ J * (B i).card ∧\n                                                    DirectedCycles.IsStrongLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) K (B i)"}
