model_prescribed_central_quotient_windows","type":"∀ {ι : Type u_1} {H : Type u_2} {E : Type u_3} [inst : Group H] [inst_1 : TopologicalSpace H]\n  [inst_2 : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_3 : NormedSpace ℝ E] [inst_4 : CompleteSpace E] [FiniteDimensional ℝ E]\n  [inst_6 : ChartedSpace E H] [inst_7 : LieGroup (modelWithCornersSelf ℝ E) (↑⊤) H] (U : Ultrafilter ι)\n  (G : ι → Type u_4) [(i : ι) → Fintype (G i)] (L : (i : ι) → DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra (G i)),\n  (∀ (i : ι), (L i).DivisionClosed) →\n    (∀ (i : ι), (L i).Reversible) →\n      ∀ (A : (i : ι) → Finset (G i)) {Ka : ℕ},\n        (∀ (i : ι), DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) Ka (A i)) →\n          ∀\n            (π :\n              DirectedCycles.LocalGroupHom (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L)\n                (DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.ofGroup H))\n            (C : Set H),\n            IsCompact C →\n              (π.toFun '' DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i)) ⊆ C →\n                ∀ W ∈ nhds 1,\n                  (π.toFun ⁻¹' W ⊆ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i)) →\n                    (∀ (F V : Set H),\n                        IsCompact F →\n                          IsOpen V →\n                            F ⊆ V →\n                              V ⊆ W →\n                                ∃ B,\n                                  (π.toFun ⁻¹' F ⊆ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ∧\n                                    (DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ⊆ π.toFun ⁻¹' V) →\n                      ∀ (P : (i : ι) → Finset (G i)) {τ : ℝ},\n                        0 < τ →\n                          (∀ (i : ι),\n                              (L i).CentralLocalSet ↑(P i) {x | (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < 1 / 1001}\n                                {x | (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < τ}) →\n                            ∃ K R,\n                              1 ≤ K ∧\n                                0 < R ∧\n                                  ∀ (r : ℝ),\n                                    0 < r →\n                                      r < R →\n                                        ∃ B D J,\n                                          1 ≤ J ∧\n                                            (π.toFun ⁻¹' DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.closedBall 0 r ⊆\n                                                DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ∧\n                                              (DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) ⊆\n                                                  π.toFun ⁻¹'\n                                                    DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.ball 0 (1001 / 1000 * r) ∧\n                                                (∀ (i : ι),\n                                                    DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) K (B i) ∧\n                                                      B i ⊆ A i ∧ (D i).small = (L i).wordPower (↑(B i)) 200 ∧ ⋯ ∧ ⋯) ∧\n                                                  (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U,\n                                                      DirectedCycles.IsStrongLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) K\n                                                        (B i)) ∧\n                                                    ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U,\n                                                      (A i).card ≤ J * ((D i).finiteImage (B i)).card * (P i).card"}
