P : (i : ι) → Finset (G i)) (D : (i : ι) → (L i).CentralQuotientData ↑(P i)) {Ka K J Jq r c : ℕ},\n        (∀ (i : ι), DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) Ka (A i)) →\n          1 ≤ J →\n            1 ≤ Jq →\n              ∀ {C C₀ : ℝ},\n                0 ≤ C →\n                  0 ≤ C₀ →\n                    (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in F, DirectedCycles.IsStrongLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) K (B i)) →\n                      (∀ (i : ι), ↑(B i) ⊆ ↑(A i)) →\n                        (∀ (i : ι), ∀ m ≤ 200, (L i).wordPower (↑(B i)) m ⊆ (D i).small) →\n                          ∀ (τ : ℝ),\n                            (∀ (i : ι), (D i).small ⊆ {x | (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < τ}) →\n                              (∀ (i : ι),\n                                  (L i).CentralLocalSet ↑(P i) {x | (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < 1 / 1001}\n                                    {x | (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < τ}) →\n                                (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in F,\n                                    ∀ y ∈ (D i).finiteImage (B i),\n                                      ∃ x,\n                                        ↑x ∈ B i ∧\n                                          (D i).project x = y ∧\n                                            (L i).escapeNorm ↑(B i) ↑x ≤\n                                              C * (D i).algebra.escapeNorm (↑((D i).finiteImage (B i))) y) →\n                                  ∀ (u : (i : ι) → G i) (n : ι → ℕ) (p : (i : ι) → (L i).PowerSegment (u i) (2 * n i)),\n                                    (∀ (i : ι), 2 ≤ n i) →\n                                      (∀ (i : ι), u i ≠ (L i).one) →\n                                        (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in F, (L i).escapeNorm (↑(B i)) (u i) ≤ C₀ / (↑(n i) + 1)) →\n                                          (∀ (i : ι), (L i).IsNSS ↑(A i)) →\n                                            (∀ (i : ι), ∀ m < n i, (p i).power m ∈ A i) →\n                                              (∀ (i : ι), ↑(P i) = (p i).shortSignedSet (n i)) →\n                                                (∀ (i : ι), (P i).card = 2 * n i - 1) →\n                                                  (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in F,\n                                                      (A i).card ≤ J * ((D i).finiteImage (B i)).card * (P i).card) →\n                                                    ∀ (g : (i : ι) → Fin r → (D i).Carrier) (N : ι → Fin r → ℕ),\n                                                      (∀ (j : Fin r), Filter.Tendsto (fun i => N i j) F Filter.atTop) →\n                                                        (∀ (m : ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in F, m < n i) →\n                                                          (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in F,\n                                                              ∃ (hq :\n                                                                (D i).algebra.SignedWordsIn (g i) (N i)\n                                                                  ↑((D i).finiteImage (B i))),\n                                                                Function.Injective ((D i).algebra.orderedGrid hq) ∧\n                                                                  (∀ (x : (D i).Carrier),\n                                                                      (D i).algebra.GeneratorCommutators\n                                                                          (Set.range (g i)) c x →\n                                                                        x = (D i).algebra.one) ∧\n                                                                    ((D i).finiteImage (B i)).card ≤\n                                                                      Jq * ∏ j, (2 * N i j + 1)) →\n                                                            ∃ T M,\n                                                              3 ≤ T ∧\n                                                                1 ≤ M ∧\n                                                                  (∀ (j : Fin (r + 1)),\n                                                                      Filter.Tendsto\n                                                                        (fun i => Fin.lastCases (n i) (N i) j / T) F\n                                                                        Filter.atTop) ∧\n                                                                    ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in F,\n                                                                      ∃ W,\n                                                                        (W.lengths = fun j =>\n                                                                            Fin.lastCases (n i) (N i) j / T) ∧\n                                                                          (A i).card ≤ M * ∏ j, (⋯ + 1)"}
