al_quotient_of_prescribed_window","type":"∀ {G : Type u_1} [Fintype G] (L : DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra G),\n  L.DivisionClosed →\n    L.Reversible →\n      ∀ (A P B : Finset G) {J : ℕ},\n        DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup L J B →\n          ∀ {r : ℝ},\n            L.CentralLocalSet ↑P {x | L.escapeNorm (↑A) x < 1 / 1001} {x | L.escapeNorm (↑A) x < r} →\n              L.AllProductsDefined (↑B) 4800 →\n                (∀ n ≤ 4800, ∀ x ∈ L.wordPower (↑B) n, L.escapeNorm (↑A) x < min r (1 / 1001)) →\n                  ∃ D,\n                    D.small = L.wordPower (↑B) 200 ∧\n                      (∀ n ≤ 200, L.wordPower (↑B) n ⊆ D.small) ∧\n                        D.small ⊆ {x | L.escapeNorm (↑A) x < r} ∧\n                          DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup D.algebra J (D.finiteImage B) ∧\n                            D.algebra.DivisionClosed ∧ D.algebra.Reversible ∧ B.card ≤ (D.finiteImage B).card * P.card"}
