dCycles.LocalConnectedScaledModel","name":"DirectedCycles.local_connected_model_one_parameter","type":"∀ {ι : Type u_1} (U : Ultrafilter ι) (G : ι → Type u_2) (L : (i : ι) → DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra (G i))\n  {H : Type u_3} [inst : Group H] [inst_1 : TopologicalSpace H] [IsTopologicalGroup H] [T2Space H] [PreconnectedSpace H]\n  [Nontrivial H],\n  (∀ (i : ι), (L i).DivisionClosed) →\n    (∀ (i : ι), (L i).Reversible) →\n      ∀ (A : (i : ι) → Set (G i)) (u : (i : ι) → G i) (N M : ι → ℕ) (p : (i : ι) → (L i).PowerSegment (u i) (M i)),\n        (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L).one ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A →\n          (∀ x ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A,\n              ∀ y ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A, (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L).Defined x y) →\n            (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, 0 < N i) →\n              (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, 2 * N i ≤ M i) →\n                (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, ∀ x ∈ A i, (L i).inv x ∈ A i) →\n                  (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, ∀ n < N i, (p i).power n ∈ A i) →\n                    (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, (p i).power (N i) ∉ A i) →\n                      (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, (L i).escapeNorm (A i) (u i) = 1 / ↑(N i)) →\n                        (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U,\n                            ∀ v ∈ A i, v ≠ (L i).one → (L i).escapeNorm (A i) (u i) ≤ (L i).escapeNorm (A i) v) →\n                          ∀\n                            (π :\n                              DirectedCycles.LocalGroupHom (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L)\n                                (DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.ofGroup H))\n                            (V : Set H),\n                            IsCompact V →\n                              (∀ (x : H), (∀ (n : ℕ), x ^ n ∈ V) → x = 1) →\n                                (∀ x ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A, π.toFun x ∈ V) →\n                                  ∀ (W : Set H),\n                                    IsOpen W →\n                                      1 ∈ W →\n                                        (∀ (x : DirectedCycles.LocalUltraproduct (↑U) G),\n                                            π.toFun x ∈ W → x ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A) →\n                                          (∀ y ∈ W, ∃ x, π.toFun x = y) →\n                                            ∃ φ,\n                                              Continuous φ ∧\n                                                φ 0 = 1 ∧\n                                                  (∀ (s t : ℝ), φ (s + t) = φ s * φ t) ∧\n                                                    φ 1 ≠ 1 ∧\n                                                      ∀ (t : ℝ),\n                                                        |t| ≤ 1 →\n                                                          φ t =\n                                                            π.toFun (DirectedCycles.localScaledPower U G L u N M p t)"}
