 '' S ⊆\n                                DirectedCycles.lieExponential ''\n                                  Metric.closedBall 0 (1001 / 1000 * (r / (10 * ↑(1000 * K ^ 3)))) →\n                              (∀ x ∈ L.wordPower A N,\n                                  π.toFun x ∈ DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.ball 0 r → x ∈ A) →\n                                (∀ x ∈ A,\n                                    π.toFun x ∈\n                                        DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.ball 0 (r / (10 * ↑(1000 * K ^ 3))) →\n                                      x ∈ S) →\n                                  L.AllProductsDefined (L.conjugates S (L.wordPower A 4)) (1000 * K ^ 3) ∧\n                                    L.wordPower (L.conjugates S (L.wordPower A 4)) (1000 * K ^ 3) ⊆ A ∧\n                                      (∀ (x : G),\n                                          (∀ (j : ℕ), 1 ≤ j → j ≤ 1000 → L.PowerIn (L.wordPower A 100) x j) → x ∈ A) ∧\n                                        ∀ (x : G), (∀ (j : ℕ), 1 ≤ j → j ≤ 1000000 * K ^ 3 → L.PowerIn A x j) → x ∈ S"}
