elControl","name":"DirectedCycles.local_lie_target_corrected_model_control","type":"∀ {ι : Type u_1} (U : Ultrafilter ι) (G : ι → Type u_2) (L : (i : ι) → DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra (G i))\n  {H : Type u_3} {E : Type u_4} [inst : TopologicalSpace H] [inst_1 : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_2 : NormedSpace ℝ E]\n  [inst_3 : ChartedSpace E H] {Q : DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra H} (D : DirectedCycles.LocalExponentialData Q),\n  (∀ (i : ι), (L i).DivisionClosed) →\n    (∀ (i : ι), (L i).Reversible) →\n      ∀ (B : (i : ι) → Set (G i)) (g u : (i : ι) → G i) (N₁ M₁ N₀ M₀ : ι → ℕ)\n        (p : (i : ι) → (L i).PowerSegment (g i) (M₁ i)) (q : (i : ι) → (L i).PowerSegment (u i) (M₀ i)),\n        (∀ (n : ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, n < N₁ i) →\n          (∀ (n : ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, n < N₀ i) →\n            (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, 2 * N₁ i ≤ M₁ i) →\n              (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, 4 * N₀ i ≤ M₀ i) →\n                (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, ∀ x ∈ B i, (L i).inv x ∈ B i) →\n                  (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, ∀ n < N₁ i, (p i).power n ∈ B i) →\n                    (∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, ∀ n < N₀ i, (q i).power n ∈ B i) →\n                      ∀ (π : DirectedCycles.LocalGroupHom (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L) Q) (V : Set H),\n                        (∀ (x : H) (q : Q.PowerSequence x), (∀ (n : ℕ), q.power n ∈ V) → x = Q.one) →\n                          (∀ z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G B, π.toFun z ∈ V) →\n                            ∀ (φ ψ : ℝ → H),\n                              (∀ (t : ℝ), |t| ≤ 1 → φ t = π.toFun (DirectedCycles.localScaledPower U G L g N₁ M₁ p t)) →\n                                (∀ (t : ℝ),\n                                    |t| ≤ 1 → ψ t = π.toFun (DirectedCycles.localScaledPower U G L u N₀ M₀ q t)) →\n                                  (∀ (s t : ℝ), |s| + |t| ≤ 2 → Q.mulRel (ψ s) (ψ t) (ψ (s + t))) →\n                                    ∀ {r δ t t' : ℝ},\n                                      0 < r →\n                                      