 : ℕ), x ^ n ∈ V) → x = 1) →\n                                  (∀ z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A, π.toFun z ∈ V) →\n                                    ∀ {R r δ : ℝ},\n                                      0 < r →\n                                        0 < δ →\n                                          δ ≤ 1 →\n                                            1001 / 1000 * r < R →\n                                              Set.InjOn DirectedCycles.lieExponential (Metric.ball 0 R) →\n                                                (∀ z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A,\n                                                    π.toFun z ∈\n                                                      DirectedCycles.lieExponential ''\n                                                        Metric.closedBall 0 (1001 / 1000 * r)) →\n                                                  (∀ (z : DirectedCycles.LocalUltraproduct (↑U) G),\n                                                      π.toFun z ∈ DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.ball 0 r →\n                                                        z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G A) →\n                                                    (∀ z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G B,\n                                                        π.toFun z ∈\n                                                          DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.closedBall 0 ⋯) →\n                                                      (∀ (z : DirectedCycles.LocalUltraproduct (↑U) G),\n                                                          π.toFun z ∈\n                                                              DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' Metric.ball 0 (δ * r) →\n                                                            z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G B) →\n                                                        ∃ t ∈ Set.Ioo (99 / 100 * δ) (101 / 100 * δ),\n                                                          Filter.Tendsto (fun i => ↑(K i) / ↑(N i)) (↑U) (nhds t) ∧\n                                                            ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, ⋯"}
