s.local_to_local_minimal_lift_exit_unbounded_of_kernel","type":"∀ {ι : Type u_1} (U : Ultrafilter ι) (G : ι → Type u_2) (L : (i : ι) → DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra (G i))\n  {H : Type u_3} (Q : DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra H),\n  (∀ (i : ι), (L i).DivisionClosed) →\n    ∀ (B : (i : ι) → Finset (G i)) (P C : (i : ι) → Set (G i)) (D : (i : ι) → (L i).CentralQuotientData (P i))\n      (g : (i : ι) → G i) (N : ι → ℕ),\n      (∀ (i : ι), 0 < N i) →\n        ∀ (hg : ∀ (i : ι), g i ∈ B i) (hB : ∀ (i : ι), ↑(B i) ⊆ (D i).small),\n          (∀ (i : ι), ↑(B i) ⊆ C i) →\n            (∀ (i : ι), (L i).one ∈ B i) →\n              (∀ (i : ι), (L i).AllProductsDefined (↑(B i)) 2) →\n                (∀ (i : ι), P i ⊆ C i) →\n                  (∀ (i : ι), ∀ x ∈ P i, (L i).inv x ∈ P i) →\n                    (∀ (i : ι), (L i).AllProductsDefined (C i) 2) →\n                      (∀ (i : ι), (L i).escapeNorm (↑(B i)) (g i) = 1 / ↑(N i)) →\n                        (∀ (i : ι) (z : ↑(D i).small),\n                            ↑z ∈ B i →\n                              (D i).project z = (D i).project ⟨g i, ⋯⟩ →\n                                (L i).escapeNorm (↑(B i)) (g i) ≤ (L i).escapeNorm ↑(B i) ↑z) →\n                          ∀ (π : DirectedCycles.LocalGroupHom (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L) Q),\n                            (∀ (z : DirectedCycles.LocalUltraproduct (↑U) G),\n                                π.toFun z = Q.one → z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i)) →\n                              π.toFun (DirectedCycles.localUltraMk (↑U) G g) ∈\n                                  π.toFun '' DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G P →\n                                ∀ (n : ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, n < N i"}
