lledQuotient","name":"DirectedCycles.local_uniform_escape_controlled_quotient","type":"∀ {ι : Type u_1} (U : Ultrafilter ι) (G : ι → Type u_2) [∀ (i : ι), Finite (G i)]\n  (L : (i : ι) → DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra (G i)) {H : Type u_3} {E : Type u_4} [inst : Group H]\n  [inst_1 : TopologicalSpace H] [IsTopologicalGroup H] [T2Space H] [inst_4 : NormedAddCommGroup E]\n  [inst_5 : NormedSpace ℝ E] [inst_6 : CompleteSpace E] [inst_7 : ChartedSpace E H]\n  [hLie : LieGroup (modelWithCornersSelf ℝ E) (↑⊤) H],\n  (∀ (i : ι), (L i).DivisionClosed) →\n    (∀ (i : ι), (L i).Reversible) →\n      ∀ {Ka Kb : ℕ} (A B : (i : ι) → Finset (G i)),\n        (∀ (i : ι), DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) Ka (A i)) →\n          (∀ (i : ι), DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) Kb (B i)) →\n            (∀ (i : ι), ↑(B i) ⊆ ↑(A i)) →\n              (∀ (i : ι), (L i).IsNSS ↑(A i)) →\n                ∀ (u : (i : ι) → G i) (Nu : ι → ℕ) (pu : (i : ι) → (L i).PowerSegment (u i) (2 * Nu i)),\n                  (∀ (i : ι), 2 ≤ Nu i) →\n                    (∀ (i : ι), ∀ n < Nu i, (pu i).power n ∈ A i) →\n                      (∀ (i : ι), (pu i).power (Nu i) ∉ A i) →\n                        (∀ (i : ι), u i ∈ B i) →\n                          (∀ (i : ι), u i ≠ (L i).one) →\n                            (∀ (i : ι), (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) (u i) = 1 / ↑(Nu i)) →\n                              (∀ (i : ι),\n                                  ∀ x ∈ A i,\n                                    x ≠ (L i).one → (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) (u i) ≤ (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x) →\n                                (∀ (n : ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, n < Nu i) →\n                                  ∀\n                                    (π :\n                                      DirectedCycles.LocalGroupHom (DirectedCycles.localUltraAlgebra (↑U) G L)\n                                        (DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.ofGroup H))\n                                    (V : Set H),\n                                    IsCompact V →\n                                      (∀ (x : H), (∀ (n : ℕ), x ^ n ∈ V) → x = 1) →\n                                        (∀ z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i), π.toFun z ∈ V) →\n                                          ∀ {R r δ : ℝ},\n                                            0 < r →\n                                              0 < δ →\n                                                δ ≤ 1 →\n                                                  1001 / 1000 * r < R →\n                                                    Set.InjOn DirectedCycles.lieExponential (Metric.ball 0 R) →\n                                                      (∀ z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i),\n                                                          π.toFun z ∈ DirectedCycles.lieExponential '' ⋯) →\n                                                        (∀ (z : DirectedCycles.LocalUltraproduct (↑U) G),\n                                                            π.toFun z ∈ ⋯ →\n                                                              z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(A i)) →\n                                                          (∀ z ∈ DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(B i),\n                                                              ⋯) →\n                                                            (∀ (z : DirectedCycles.LocalUltraproduct (↑U) G), ⋯) →\n                                                              ∀ (φ : ℝ → H), ⋯"}
