 C.length), isA i → ∀ z ∈ (P i).vertices.dropLast, z.1 = C.vertex i ∧ z.2 ∈ Q₀) →\n              (∀ (i : Fin C.length),\n                  ¬isA i →\n                    ∀ z ∈ (P i).vertices.dropLast,\n                      z.1 = C.vertex i ∨ z.1 = C.vertex ((finRotate C.length) i) * (t z.2)⁻¹) →\n                (∀ (i j : Fin C.length), i ≠ j → ¬isA i → ¬isA j → (P i).vertices.Disjoint (P j).vertices) →\n                  ∃ L, C.length ≤ L.length"}
