: W),\n                  DirectedCycles.HeavyReach D π u m a b →\n                    (∀ (x : { v // π v = a }), m < 2 * {y | DirectedCycles.ReachWithin D u ↑x ↑y}.card) ∧\n                      ∀ (y : { v // π v = b }), m < 2 * {x | DirectedCycles.ReachWithin D u ↑x ↑y}.card) →\n                (∀ (a b : W), DirectedCycles.QuotientDigraph D π a b → ∃ F, ∀ (x : { x // π x = a }), D ↑x ↑(F x)) →\n                  ∃ Q,\n                    DirectedCycles.Loopless Q ∧\n                      DirectedCycles.StronglyConnected Q ∧\n                        (∀ (g : G) (a b : W), Q (g • a) (g • b) ↔ Q a b) ∧\n                          ∀ (a b : W),\n                            Q a b → ∀ (x : { v // π v = a }) (y : { v // π v = b }), ∃ P, P.length ≤ 2 * u + 1"}
