es.LocalGroupAlgebra G),\n  L.DivisionClosed →\n    L.Reversible →\n      ∀ {K : ℕ} {A : Finset G},\n        DirectedCycles.IsStrongLocalFiniteApproximateGroup L K A →\n          ∀ {g h k : G},\n            g ∈ L.wordPower (↑A) 10 →\n              h ∈ L.wordPower (↑A) 10 →\n                L.Product [L.inv g, L.inv h, g, h] k →\n                  have P := 8 * 1000 * ↑K * ↑(1000000 * K ^ 3);\n                  L.escapeNorm (↑A) k ≤ 2 * 1000 ^ 2 * ↑K ^ 11 * P ^ 2 * L.escapeNorm (↑A) g * L.escapeNorm (↑A) h"}
