_progression","type":"∀ (K : ℕ),\n  ∃ δ,\n    0 < δ ∧\n      δ ≤ 1 / 2 ∧\n        ∀ (G : Type u_2) [Fintype G] (L : DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra G) (A : Finset G),\n          DirectedCycles.IsStrongLocalFiniteApproximateGroup L K A →\n            L.DivisionClosed →\n              L.Reversible →\n                L.IsNSS ↑A →\n                  (∃ g ∈ A, g ≠ L.one) →\n                    ∃ u ∈ A,\n                      u ≠ L.one ∧\n                        ∃ N,\n                          2 ≤ N ∧\n                            ∃ p,\n                              (∀ n ≤ N - 1, p.power n ∈ A) ∧\n                                (∃ z, L.Product (List.replicate N u) z ∧ z ∉ A) ∧\n                                  L.escapeNorm (↑A) u = 1 / ↑N ∧\n                                    (DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.PowerSegment.signedProgression L p).card =\n                                        2 * N - 1 ∧\n                                      ↑(DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.PowerSegment.signedProgression L p) ⊆ ↑A ∧\n                                        L.one ∈ DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.PowerSegment.signedProgression L p ∧\n                                          (∀ y ∈ DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.PowerSegment.signedProgression L p,\n                                              L.inv y ∈\n                                                DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.PowerSegment.signedProgression L p) ∧\n                                            ∀ (x : G),\n                                              L.escapeNorm (↑A) x < δ →\n                                                ∀\n                                                  y ∈\n                                                    DirectedCycles.LocalGroupAlgebra.PowerSegment.signedProgression L p,\n                                                  L.Commute x y"}
