: ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, n < N i) ∧\n                                            ∃ D B,\n                                              (∀ (i : ι),\n                                                  DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (L i) J (B i) ∧\n                                                    η * ↑(A i).card ≤ ↑(B i).card ∧\n                                                      (∀ n ≤ 200, (L i).wordPower (↑(B i)) n ⊆ (D i).small) ∧\n                                                        DirectedCycles.IsLocalFiniteApproximateGroup (D i).algebra J\n                                                            ((D i).finiteImage (B i)) ∧\n                                                          η * ↑(A i).card ≤\n                                                            ↑((D i).finiteImage (B i)).card * ↑(P i).card) ∧\n                                                ∃ φ,\n                                                  Continuous φ ∧\n                                                    φ 0 = 1 ∧\n                                                      (∀ (s t : ℝ), φ (s + t) = φ s * φ t) ∧\n                                                        φ 1 ≠ 1 ∧\n                                                          (∀ (t : ℝ) (y : H), Commute (φ t) y) ∧\n                                                            (π.toFun ''\n                                                                  DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(P i)) =\n                                                                φ '' Set.Icc (-1) 1 ∧\n                                                              ∃ T W', ⋯"}
