 W, ∃ z, π.toFun z = y) →\n                                        ∃ N P φ,\n                                          (∀ (i : ι),\n                                              2 ≤ N i ∧\n                                                (P i).card = 2 * N i - 1 ∧\n                                                  ↑(P i) ⊆ ↑(A i) ∧\n                                                    (L i).CentralLocalSet ↑(P i)\n                                                      {x | (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < 1 / 1001}\n                                                      {x | (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < δ}) ∧\n                                            (∀ (n : ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, n < N i) ∧\n                                              Continuous φ ∧\n                                                φ 0 = 1 ∧\n                                                  (∀ (s t : ℝ), φ (s + t) = φ s * φ t) ∧\n                                                    φ 1 ≠ 1 ∧\n                                                      (∀ (t : ℝ) (y : H), Commute (φ t) y) ∧\n                                                        (π.toFun ''\n                                                            DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(P i)) =\n                                                          φ '' Set.Icc (-1) 1"}
