, π.toFun z = y) →\n                                        ∃ u N p P φ,\n                                          (∀ (i : ι),\n                                              u i ∈ A i ∧\n                                                u i ≠ (L i).one ∧\n                                                  2 ≤ N i ∧\n                                                    (∀ n < N i, (p i).power n ∈ A i) ∧\n                                                      (p i).power (N i) ∉ A i ∧\n                                                        (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) (u i) = 1 / ↑(N i) ∧\n                                                          (∀ v ∈ A i,\n                                                              v ≠ (L i).one →\n                                                                (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) (u i) ≤\n                                                                  (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) v) ∧\n                                                            (∀ (x : G i),\n                                                                (L i).escapeNorm (↑(A i)) x < δ →\n                                                                  (L i).Commute x (u i)) ∧\n                                                              (∀ n ≤ 2 * N i,\n                                                                  (p i).power n ∈ (L i).wordPower (↑(A i)) 4) ∧\n                                                                ↑(P i) = (p i).shortSignedSet (N i) ∧\n                                                                  (P i).card = 2 * N i - 1 ∧ ↑(P i) ⊆ ↑(A i) ∧ ⋯) ∧\n                                            (∀ (n : ℕ), ∀ᶠ (i : ι) in ↑U, n < N i) ∧\n                                              Continuous φ ∧\n                                                φ 0 = 1 ∧\n                                                  (∀ (s t : ℝ), φ (s + t) = φ s * φ t) ∧\n                                                    φ 1 ≠ 1 ∧\n                                                      (∀ (t : ℝ) (y : H), Commute (φ t) y) ∧\n                                                        (π.toFun ''\n                                                              DirectedCycles.localUltraSet (↑U) G fun i => ↑(P i)) =\n                                                            φ '' Set.Icc (-1) 1 ∧\n                                                          ∀ (t : ℝ),\n                                                            |t| ≤ 1 →\n                                                              φ t =\n                                                                π.toFun\n                                                                  (DirectedCycles.localScaledPower U G L u N\n                                                                    (fun i => 2 * N i) p t)"}
