\n  L.Cancellative →\n    ∀ {A S R : Set G},\n      L.one ∈ A →\n        L.one ∈ S →\n          A ⊆ R →\n            S ⊆ R →\n              L.AllProductsDefined R 3 →\n                ∀ {ε C K M θ : ℝ},\n                  0 < ε →\n                    0 ≤ C →\n                      1 ≤ K →\n                        1 ≤ M →\n                          0 ≤ θ →\n                            θ ≤ 1 / 2 →\n                              ∀ (f : G → ℝ),\n                                (∀ (x : G), f x ≠ 0 → x ∈ R) →\n                                  ‖f‖ ≤ K →\n                                    (∀ (g : G), L.escapeNorm A g ≤ C * L.derivativeNorm f g) →\n                                      (∀ (g : G), L.escapeNorm S g ≤ M * L.escapeNorm A g) →\n                                        (∃ X,\n                                            0 ≤ X ∧\n                                              ∀ (g : G), L.derivativeNorm f g ≤ X * L.restrictedEscapeDistance A ε g) →\n                                          (∀ (X : ℝ),\n                                              0 ≤ X →\n                                                (∀ (g : G),\n                                                    L.derivativeNorm f g ≤ X * L.restrictedEscapeDistance A ε g) →\n                                                  ∀ g ∈ A,\n                                                    ∀ h ∈ S,\n                                                      L.derivativeNorm (L.derivative g f) h ≤\n                                                        θ * X * L.restrictedEscapeDistance A ε g) →\n                                            ∀ (g : G),\n                                              L.escapeNorm A g ≤ 8 * C * K * M * L.restrictedEscapeDistance A ε g"}
